# Arithmetic needs numbers; numeric text counts as its number.
# Regression: `"42" times 2` printed 9.35e-310 (a pointer read as a double).
set s as "42"
show s times 2
show s plus 1
attempt
    show "abc" times 2
if fails then
    show error message
!
attempt
    show 5 modulo 0
if fails then
    show error message
!
show "b" greater than "a"
show 1234567 is "1234567"
show 1234567.5
show 10 divided by 3
